# Trivy Vulnerability & Secret Suppression File for zopen community
#
# Rules in this file are evaluated by Trivy during scanning.
# Every suppression MUST include:
#   1. A clear comment explaining the reason / false positive rationale.
#   2. The CVE/GHSA or rule ID on a standalone line.
#   3. An expiry date where applicable (e.g. # exp: 2027-01-01).
#
# Example:
# # Reason: Test-only fixture containing mock RSA private key
# # exp: 2027-01-01
# CVE-2023-00000
